7-4d0b-bea4-1e9a051592c6:tool:979:15574","beat":"explain","skillId":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s4","at":"2026-10-15T07:50:16.270Z","board":"written board: \"2 + 3 = 5\" \"5 − 3 = ?\""},{"seq":10,"intentId":"adbe0e85-2d27-4d0b-bea4-1e9a051592c6:tool:982:21036","beat":"explain","skillId":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s4","at":"2026-10-15T07:50:21.733Z","board":"written board: \"5 − 3 = ?\" \"3 − 5 = ?\""}],"lane2":{"teacher":"agent","agent":{"plan":"Cheezein hataana; peeche ginna; aur kitne ka abhyas; jodna-ghatana ka rishta","notes":[],"posed":["c1-maths-ch05-t02-i01","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i05","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i09","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i03","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i10","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i04","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i11","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i06","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i07","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i08"],"skill":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s4","turns":[{"who":"child","text":"umm... agar saari udd gayin to... kuch nahi bachega? zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero chidiyaan bachengi. Saari chhah udd gayin. Ab bus mein nau bachche hain aur chaar utar gaye. Kitne bachche bache?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... paanch?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, paanch bachche bache. Ab nau se chaar kadam peeche ginte hain. Nau se pehla kadam peeche kis ank par pahunchega?"},{"who":"child","text":"zara...aatth?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau se pehla kadam aath par aata hai. Nau shuruaat hai, pehla kadam nahi. Ab saat se teen kadam peeche gino. Kahan pahunche?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... chaar?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, chaar par pahunche. Saat se peeche teen kadam hain: chhah, paanch, chaar. Ab aath se teen kadam peeche chalo. Kahan pahunche?"},{"who":"child","text":"5?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, paanch par pahunche. Aath se teen kadam peeche: saat, chhah, paanch. Ab do samoohon ko milakar dekhen. Riya ke paas paanch choodiyaan aur Zoya ke paas teen hain. Riya ke paas kitni zyada hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... aat?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne paanch aur teen jodkar aath kaha. Par sawaal hai: Riya ke paas kitni zyada hain. Teen-teen choodiyaan milao; Riya ki kitni choodiyaan bina jodi bachengi?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... do?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, do choodiyaan zyada hain. Teen-teen ki jodi bani, aur Riya ki do bachin. Ab team ko saat run chahiye, tumne chaar bana liye. Aur kitne run chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... saaat?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne saat kaha; saat poore chahiye, aur chaar ban chuke hain. Chaar se saat tak ek-ek run badhao. Kitne aur run lagenge?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... teen?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, teen run aur chahiye. Chaar mein teen jodo, toh saat hote hain. Ab do aur teen milkar paanch hain. Toh paanch mein se teen hatao, kitne bachte hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... do?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, do bachte hain. Do aur teen milkar paanch hain; teen hatao toh do bachenge. Ab socho: paanch toffee mein se teen hata sakte ho, ya teen mein se paanch?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... do kar sakte hain?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne 'do' kaha. Paanch toffee haath mein hain; unmein se teen hata sakte ho. Teen toffee mein se paanch hata sakte ho kya?"},{"who":"child","text":"5 − 3 kar sakte hain"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, paanch mein se teen hata sakte ho. Teen mein se paanch hataane ko paanch toffee hi nahi hain. Bholu kehta hai ki teen mein se paanch hataao toh do bachte hain. Kya Bholu sahi hai?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.07242,"tokens":53457},"boards":11,"lastMs":3103,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["5 − 3 = ?","3 − 5 = ?"],"words":"the board shows writing; written on it: 5 − 3 = ?; 3 − 5 = ?"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s1":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i05","kind":"predict"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer"}],"grades":["correct","correct","correct"],"evidence":"Kai sahi jawaab; bus mein bhi sahi"},"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s2":{"read":"part